ng2","nomads.6005.gases","nomads.6005.livingmetal","nomads.6005.minerals","nomads.6005.minerals2","nomads.6005.motes","nomads.6005.nanites","nomads.6005.physics","nomads.6005.physics2","nomads.6005.society","nomads.6005.society2","nomads.6005.threads","nomads.6005.zro"],"names":{"event_target:contract_issuer.GetName":{"zh":"委托方","en":"the client","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现委托这项合同的一方名称。","en":"In the game, the name of the party that commissioned this contract appears here."}}}}],"summary":{"text":"# 发现机遇 / A Chance Find\n\n- 分类 Category：C8 银河轶事 / C8 Galactic miscellany · DLC: Nomads\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n游牧帝国执行任一合约期间，合约的月度回调 nomads.6000 每月有2/20机会从随机合约事件池抽取（常见70、稀有25、独特5）；本事件属于常见池，且只会发生一次（fire_only_once）。\n\nWhile a nomadic empire runs any contract, the contract's monthly hook nomads.6000 has a 2/20 monthly chance to draw from the contract event pools (common 70, rare 25, unique 5); this event is in the common pool and happens only once (fire_only_once).\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n合约途中发现一批资源或研究机会，从若干随机奖励中选一。\n\nA chance find during a contract: pick one of several randomly offered rewards, or give it back.\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n单页事件，选项只带来即时效果，没有后续窗口。\n\nOne window; the options only have immediate effects, no follow-up window.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 审阅 Reviewed 2026-10-12\n- 来源 Sources：events/nomads_events_1.txt:15777-16145; events/nomads_events_1.txt:15716-15763\n- 已核对抽取路径与触发条件。这些合约插曲彼此独立，不合并为一个故事。\n  Checked the draw path and trigger. These contract incidents are independent and are not merged into one story.\n- 注：本文件的行号取自游戏文件本身；编译数据中该文件记录的行号有偏移（见账本请求）。\n  Note: line numbers are from the game file itself; the compiled records for this file carry shifted line numbers (see ledger requests).\n- （以上为审阅者撰写的说明，不是游戏原文；原文见阅读页。）\n  (Commentary written by the reviewer, not game text; the original text is in the reader.)\n","path":"summaries/event-nomads-6005.md"}}